"frontend. Si <strong>no</strong> se fija <strong>ninguna moneda base</"
"strong> mediante el menú <strong>Tipos de cambio</strong>, los selectores de "
"moneda <strong>no estarán visibles</strong> en el módulo de acceso."

#: classes/admin/SettingsPage.php:151
msgid "Place orders using base currency"
msgstr "Realizar pedidos utilizando la moneda base"

#: classes/admin/SettingsPage.php:152
msgid ""
"By default, the orders are placed via frontend according to the currency "
"selected by the user. If the following option is enabled, the orders will be "
"always placed using base currency set via the <strong>Excange rates</strong> "
"menu. This may be useful in case you are using a 3rd party payment gateway "
"plugins that are not properly managing product prices according to the "
"selected currency."
msgstr ""
"Por defecto, los pedidos se realizan a través de frontend según la divisa "
"seleccionada por el usuario. Si la siguiente opción está activada, los "
"pedidos se realizarán siempre utilizando la moneda base establecida en el "
"menú <strong>Tipos de cambio</strong>. Esto puede ser útil en caso de que "
"esté utilizando plugins de una pasarela de pago de terceros que no estén "
"gestionando correctamente los precios de los productos de acuerdo con la "
"divisa seleccionada."

#: classes/admin/SettingsPage.php:156
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Place orders using base currency"
msgid "Place orders using base currency and prices"
msgstr "Realizar pedidos utilizando la moneda base"

#: classes/admin/SettingsPage.php:160
msgid "Force base currency usage on the Checkout page"
msgstr ""

#: classes/admin/SettingsPage.php:161
msgid ""
"This option is stronger that the previous. It forces the base currency usage "
"by automatically switching the current currency to the base currency when "
"the customer reaches the Checkout page. Note that when enabling this option "
"the currency selectors won't be displayed. This may be helpful in case some "
"payment gateways are preventing placing orders due to unsupported "
"currencies. <strong>The orders will be placed using the base currency</"
"strong>."
msgstr ""

#: classes/admin/SettingsPage.php:165
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Use base currency and prices"
msgid "Force base currency usage on checkout page"
msgstr "Usar la moneda base y los precios"

#: classes/admin/SettingsPage.php:169
msgid "Disable \"?currency=\" URL parameter"
msgstr "Desactivar el parámetro \"?currency=\" URL"

#: classes/admin/SettingsPage.php:170
msgid ""
"By default, the plugin adds the <strong>?currency=</strong> parameter to the "
"site URL. This prevents caching plugins to serve pages with a currency "
"different by the selected one. <strong>Disabling this option may cause "
"unexpected behavior when using caching plugins</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Por defecto, el plugin añade el parámetro <strong>?currency=</strong> a la "
"URL del sitio. Esto evita que los plugins de caché sirvan páginas con una "
"moneda diferente a la seleccionada. <strong>Desactivar esta opción puede "
"provocar un comportamiento inesperado al utilizar plugins de caché</strong>."

#: classes/admin/SettingsPage.php:174
msgid "Disable ?currency= parameter"
msgstr "Desactivar ?currency= parámetro"

